# skill: theme-brutal

## Contract
- **語義承諾**：Neo-Brutalism 大膽撞色風，以黑粗框（2-3px #000）、高對比、鮮豔色塊、零陰影為特徵
- **CSS Custom Properties**：
  - `--bg: #FFF8F0` — 頁面背景（米白）
  - `--card-bg: #FFFFFF` — 卡片背景
  - `--border-color: #000000` — 邊框色（純黑）
  - `--accent: #FF6B35` — 主強調色（橙）
  - `--danger: #FF0044` — 危險/錯誤色
  - `--success: #00C853` — 成功色
  - `--warning: #FFD600` — 警告色
  - `--text: #000000` — 主要文字

## Dependencies
- **依賴**：無
- **可選依賴**：無
- **排斥**：無

## Slots
無 slots（主題是全域 CSS）

## Boundaries
- **系統邊界**：Presentation Layer
- **操作邊界**：
  - ✅ 操作：全域 CSS 樣式定義、黑粗框 DOM 覆寫
  - ❌ 不操作：JavaScript 邏輯、狀態管理

## Examples
```css
body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); }
.card { background: var(--card-bg); border: 2px solid var(--border-color); }
.btn-primary { background: var(--accent); box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border-color); }
```

[style]
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

:root {
  --bg: #FFF8F0;
  --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
  --border-color: #000000;
  --accent: #FF6B35;
  --danger: #FF0044;
  --success: #00C853;
  --warning: #FFD600;
  --text: #000000;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans TC', sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.warehouse-header {
  background: var(--accent) !important;
  border-bottom: 3px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  padding: 20px 32px !important;
  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border-color) !important;
}
.header-title { font-size: 24px !important; font-weight: 800 !important; letter-spacing: -1px; }

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--accent) !important;
  border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  padding: 10px 20px !important;
  font-weight: 800 !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--border-color) !important;
  transition: all 0.1s ease !important;
  color: #000 !important;
}
.btn-primary:hover { transform: translate(-2px, -2px) !important; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--border-color) !important; }

.btn-edit {
  border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  background: #FFF8F0 !important;
  color: #000 !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  font-weight: 700 !important;
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--border-color) !important;
  transition: all 0.1s ease !important;
}
.btn-edit:hover { transform: translate(-1px, -1px) !important; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--border-color) !important; }

.btn-delete {
  border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  background: var(--danger) !important;
  color: #fff !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  font-weight: 700 !important;
  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--border-color) !important;
  transition: all 0.1s ease !important;
}
.btn-delete:hover { transform: translate(-1px, -1px) !important; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--border-color) !important; }

.inventory-table { border-collapse: separate !important; border-spacing: 0 !important; border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important; }
.inventory-table th {
  background: #000 !important;
  color: #FFF8F0 !important;
  font-size: 12px !important;
  font-weight: 700 !important;
  text-transform: uppercase !important;
  letter-spacing: 1px !important;
  padding: 12px 16px !important;
  border: none !important;
}
.inventory-table td {
  border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  border-top: none !important;
  padding: 14px 16px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  background: var(--card-bg) !important;
}
.inventory-table tr:hover td { background: var(--warning) !important; }

.toolbar { background: transparent !important; border: none !important; padding: 24px 0 !important; }
.search-box input {
  border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: #FFF8F0 !important;
  padding: 10px 14px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--border-color) !important;
}
.search-box input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--accent) !important; outline-offset: 2px !important; }
.filter-group select {
  border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important;
  border-radius: 0 !important;
  background: #FFF8F0 !important;
  padding: 10px 14px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--border-color) !important;
  cursor: pointer !important;
}
.filter-group select option { background: #FFF8F0; }

.badge { padding: 4px 12px !important; border-radius: 0 !important; font-size: 12px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important; }
.badge-ok { background: var(--success) !important; }
.badge-warning { background: var(--warning) !important; }
.badge-danger { background: var(--danger) !important; color: #fff !important; }
.category-tag { padding: 4px 12px !important; border-radius: 0 !important; font-size: 12px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; border: 2px solid var(--border-color) !important; }
.cat-electronics { background: #00B4D8 !important; }
.cat-tools { background: var(--warning) !important; }
.cat-materials { background: var(--success) !important; }
.cat-packaging { background: #C77DFF !important; }
